WEBVTT

1
00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:27.027
<i>That's like Alfred Hitchcock</i>
<i>explained the essence of suspense.</i>

2
00:00:27.944 --> 00:00:33.867
<i>First the audience sees,</i>
<i>that someone is planting a bomb under the table.</i>

3
00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.119
<i>Then the main character,</i>

4
00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:39.456
<i>not guessing,</i>
<i>sipping coffee at that table.</i>

5
00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Knowing that the bomb</i>
<i>could explode at any moment,</i>

6
00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:02.854
<i>spectators feel tension and anxiety.</i>

7
00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:14.407
<i>That's exactly how I feel right now.</i>

8
00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:25.835
<i>I saw how they planted a bomb...</i>

9
00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:31.925
<i>- </i>Hello.
- Hello!

10
00:01:32.008 --> 00:01:32.842
Greetings!

11
00:01:35.678 --> 00:01:39.349
<i>…and I'm nervous, not knowing when it will explode.</i>

12
00:01:41.142 --> 00:01:42.477
That's why I'm here.

13
00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:44.229
You must have just moved.

14
00:01:44.312 --> 00:01:45.814
Yes, here you go.

15
00:01:45.897 --> 00:01:47.690
Thank you. Very nice.

16
00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:49.192
- Little things.
<i>- No.</i>

17
00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:52.695
- I'll see you again.
<i>- I'm not nervous. I'd rather be annoyed.</i>

18
00:01:55.031 --> 00:01:58.284
Mom, did someone bring you ttok?

19
00:01:58.368 --> 00:02:00.328
Ttok? What ttok?

20
00:02:02.705 --> 00:02:04.040
Indifferently. go

21
00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:06.376
- Come on.
- Be sure to eat.

22
00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:07.293
Good.

23
00:02:48.793 --> 00:02:51.087
Did he visit all the neighbors except us?

24
00:02:53.923 --> 00:02:56.092
<i>And the most angry...</i>

25
00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:10.481
<i>Goodbye.</i>

26
00:03:20.158 --> 00:03:25.580
<i>…that he annoys me even more,</i>
<i>when trying not to be annoying.</i>

27
00:04:02.242 --> 00:04:03.243
Ahoy!

28
00:04:03.993 --> 00:04:04.827
What is it?

29
00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:08.164
Excuse me.

30
00:04:08.248 --> 00:04:09.082
What was it?

31
00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:17.131
<i>I have no idea what he's up to.</i>

32
00:04:27.976 --> 00:04:31.229
<i>I just do the best I can.</i>

33
00:04:31.312 --> 00:04:32.897
Chune, the flowers have bloomed.

34
00:04:33.439 --> 00:04:34.691
Yes. When did it happen?

35
00:04:34.774 --> 00:04:36.276
Mom, I'm leaving.

36
00:04:37.235 --> 00:04:38.069
- Gomme.
- What?

37
00:04:38.152 --> 00:04:39.737
Do not forget about the medicine.

38
00:04:39.821 --> 00:04:41.406
- Gomme.
- Okay!

39
00:04:41.489 --> 00:04:42.907
Wait!

40
00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:46.661
Gomm!

41
00:04:46.744 --> 00:04:49.414
<i>She asked not to loom before her eyes,</i>

42
00:04:49.497 --> 00:04:52.166
<i>so settle in the neighborhood -</i>
<i>too much even for me.</i>

43
00:04:56.087 --> 00:04:56.963
Chune

44
00:04:57.839 --> 00:05:00.091
What attracted you to this house?

45
00:05:00.174 --> 00:05:01.009
What?

46
00:05:02.677 --> 00:05:07.765
I said that I often saw him
on the way to the rehabilitation center.

47
00:05:08.266 --> 00:05:10.101
And what? you don't like

48
00:05:10.184 --> 00:05:15.356
I need a good reason
to use as an excuse.

49
00:05:16.691 --> 00:05:17.942
It's just so dishonest.

50
00:05:18.026 --> 00:05:19.152
What?

51
00:05:19.819 --> 00:05:21.154
Nothing. Let's go to the house.

52
00:05:22.572 --> 00:05:25.325
<i>I tried to avoid her,</i>

53
00:05:25.825 --> 00:05:28.161
<i>until I come up with a decent excuse.</i>

54
00:05:28.244 --> 00:05:29.078
Congratulations

55
00:05:30.246 --> 00:05:32.832
I have a pork shoulder for zhchige...

56
00:05:36.836 --> 00:05:41.174
<i>As I said, she stands out.</i>

57
00:05:42.258 --> 00:05:43.760
how much for you

58
00:05:43.843 --> 00:05:45.428
A kilogram, please.

59
00:05:50.308 --> 00:05:52.977
<i>But now she seems to… How to say it?</i>

60
00:05:54.687 --> 00:05:57.065
are you whole

61
00:05:57.148 --> 00:05:58.775
What do you want? step away

62
00:06:00.943 --> 00:06:01.778
But...

63
00:06:01.861 --> 00:06:05.156
- And ride me!
- What is there?

64
00:06:05.239 --> 00:06:07.909
Take it easy, one at a time.

65
00:06:09.077 --> 00:06:10.078
That's it!

66
00:06:11.412 --> 00:06:12.330
Rather?

67
00:06:14.624 --> 00:06:15.708
Ahead!

68
00:06:16.626 --> 00:06:18.544
- Faster!
- Even faster?

69
00:06:20.338 --> 00:06:21.756
- Hold on.
- Faster!

70
00:06:21.839 --> 00:06:23.841
- Yes!
- More fun!

71
00:06:24.675 --> 00:06:28.262
<i>She seems different.</i>

72
00:06:34.644 --> 00:06:36.729
Madam, allow me.

73
00:06:36.813 --> 00:06:38.773
- Everything is fine!
- Give it to me.

74
00:06:39.357 --> 00:06:41.692
You are as beautiful as you are kind.

75
00:06:42.693 --> 00:06:44.362
- Give me yours too.
- No!

76
00:06:44.445 --> 00:06:46.948
- I will carry!
- Come on, I'm going there anyway.

77
00:06:50.993 --> 00:06:52.161
Take your time!

78
00:06:52.245 --> 00:06:53.496
Yes, ma'am.

79
00:06:54.122 --> 00:06:56.791
<i>She has features that I hadn't noticed before.</i>

80
00:07:00.253 --> 00:07:01.796
He is such a strange guy.

81
00:07:06.134 --> 00:07:07.969
What? What are you looking at?

82
00:07:14.976 --> 00:07:18.229
Are you knocking on our door or something? You don't…

83
00:07:21.816 --> 00:07:23.693
What? Is he really coming here?

84
00:07:23.776 --> 00:07:25.153
What does he do?

85
00:07:26.154 --> 00:07:27.905
What does he do? Why?

86
00:07:32.243 --> 00:07:34.120
No. What to do?

87
00:07:36.789 --> 00:07:37.707
A minute

88
00:07:39.459 --> 00:07:42.503
Did I do something wrong? Why am I hiding?

89
00:07:44.338 --> 00:07:45.339
Seriously?

90
00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:50.344
Who…

91
00:07:53.264 --> 00:07:54.140
Mubi!

92
00:08:00.062 --> 00:08:01.647
EPISODE 3

93
00:08:01.731 --> 00:08:08.196
KEEP YOUR FRIENDS CLOSE,
AND THE ENEMIES ARE EVEN CLOSER

94
00:08:44.106 --> 00:08:45.107
Who…

95
00:08:47.026 --> 00:08:48.027
Mubi!

96
00:08:54.867 --> 00:08:55.701
What?

97
00:08:57.036 --> 00:09:00.122
<i>It turns out I missed a lot.</i>

98
00:09:04.627 --> 00:09:07.380
Are you really Jung Hoo?

99
00:09:07.463 --> 00:09:08.548
Yes.

100
00:09:12.218 --> 00:09:13.219
But your…

101
00:09:16.138 --> 00:09:20.226
Do people's genes change after a trip to the US?

102
00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:22.937
Apparently. There is more.

103
00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:25.940
So, have you become healthier?

104
00:09:29.068 --> 00:09:29.944
As you see

105
00:09:30.027 --> 00:09:30.903
hit me

106
00:09:34.282 --> 00:09:36.617
And you never let yourself be heard?

107
00:09:40.413 --> 00:09:43.791
As? I didn't have your number.

108
00:09:43.874 --> 00:09:46.586
After the operation I learned
that you changed your number

109
00:09:46.669 --> 00:09:48.254
Then I would call home.

110
00:09:48.337 --> 00:09:49.505
The number was cancelled.

111
00:09:49.589 --> 00:09:50.923
I would send an email.

112
00:09:51.007 --> 00:09:52.049
To which address?

113
00:09:52.133 --> 00:09:53.509
Then, as it…

114
00:09:53.593 --> 00:09:55.845
Social networks. I had to be found.

115
00:09:55.928 --> 00:09:57.680
Are you on social networks?

116
00:09:57.763 --> 00:09:58.681
No.

117
00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:01.434
do you see

118
00:10:03.019 --> 00:10:07.773
I was worried you'd moved
and i will never see you again

119
00:10:07.857 --> 00:10:10.026
I even thought about search sites…

120
00:10:10.109 --> 00:10:13.446
I am so glad. You've been through so much, Jung Hoo.

121
00:10:15.406 --> 00:10:17.575
But how did you grow up like that?

122
00:10:17.658 --> 00:10:20.953
Your home hasn't changed. The same as it was.

123
00:10:22.288 --> 00:10:23.289
- Listen.
- What?

124
00:10:23.372 --> 00:10:27.043
Were you bullied in the US?

125
00:10:27.627 --> 00:10:31.339
Maybe the kids teased you
because you were short-tempered.

126
00:10:31.422 --> 00:10:34.425
You gave me something just in case.
Don't you remember?

127
00:10:35.551 --> 00:10:36.385
Truth?

128
00:10:37.803 --> 00:10:38.638
Now.

129
00:10:40.848 --> 00:10:43.684
Said take it out
if someone tries to make fun of me.

130
00:10:43.768 --> 00:10:46.354
{\an8}TAEKWONDO

131
00:10:46.437 --> 00:10:47.688
You are amazing!

132
00:10:47.772 --> 00:10:49.607
When I didn't know English yet,

133
00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:51.776
I kept this photo as a talisman.

134
00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:55.321
And they didn't touch me.
They must have thought I was crazy.

135
00:10:55.404 --> 00:11:00.826
Everyone who was born in this country
in the 90s, there is such a photo.

136
00:11:02.745 --> 00:11:04.580
My glory days.

137
00:11:07.541 --> 00:11:08.793
{\an8}TAEKWONDO

138
00:11:13.422 --> 00:11:14.340
Mubi!

139
00:11:21.347 --> 00:11:22.515
what are you doing there

140
00:11:23.015 --> 00:11:24.058
We should move.

141
00:11:24.141 --> 00:11:25.810
We have a housewarming party today.

142
00:11:27.019 --> 00:11:28.270
We will move after the housewarming.

143
00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:31.816
Don't talk nonsense.

144
00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:34.402
When will Xi Chun come? Call him.

145
00:11:38.572 --> 00:11:39.407
What the…

146
00:11:41.617 --> 00:11:42.451
Quickly.

147
00:11:47.039 --> 00:11:49.375
"TWO SEASONS" - AUTHOR: SONG CHU A

148
00:11:51.961 --> 00:11:53.462
Want to buy a ticket?

149
00:11:53.963 --> 00:11:54.964
Yes.

150
00:11:55.548 --> 00:11:57.383
On "Two Seasons".

151
00:11:57.466 --> 00:11:59.468
One ticket for "Two Seasons"?

152
00:12:00.344 --> 00:12:02.012
What session?

153
00:12:04.098 --> 00:12:06.600
Never mind. Thank you for your help.

154
00:12:08.894 --> 00:12:11.063
Two tickets to "Two Seasons".

155
00:12:18.279 --> 00:12:19.238
Hong Si Chun.

156
00:12:29.206 --> 00:12:30.499
Shall we watch together?

157
00:12:51.687 --> 00:12:52.938
Looking for a switch?

158
00:12:53.647 --> 00:12:55.733
Right behind.

159
00:12:56.233 --> 00:12:58.986
But I do not advise turning on the light in the yard.

160
00:12:59.069 --> 00:13:00.988
Attracts insects.

161
00:13:01.071 --> 00:13:02.239
And who are you?

162
00:13:02.323 --> 00:13:04.825
I used to live here. Nice to meet you!

163
00:13:08.621 --> 00:13:11.624
I was in the house across the street and decided to stop by.

164
00:13:12.291 --> 00:13:14.543
- Why were you in that house?
- Because there...

165
00:13:16.587 --> 00:13:17.421
Do you know them?

166
00:13:19.173 --> 00:13:20.257
No, I don't know.

167
00:13:22.676 --> 00:13:24.553
I came to my Mubi.

168
00:13:27.181 --> 00:13:28.349
So you know her.

169
00:13:30.184 --> 00:13:31.018
listen

170
00:13:31.769 --> 00:13:35.523
do you want to see the house? Will you stand there?

171
00:13:35.606 --> 00:13:36.982
Really? Is it possible?

172
00:13:38.359 --> 00:13:40.236
Quietly. Do you think I will allow it?

173
00:13:43.989 --> 00:13:45.658
you are strange

174
00:13:47.701 --> 00:13:49.036
I came to ask

175
00:13:49.119 --> 00:13:53.541
maybe you haven't seen it
metal box in the pantry.

176
00:13:55.709 --> 00:13:56.544
Oh, this thing!

177
00:13:56.627 --> 00:13:58.295
- Is she still here?
- Yes!

178
00:13:59.129 --> 00:14:00.005
Seriously?

179
00:14:01.048 --> 00:14:02.550
There.

180
00:14:02.633 --> 00:14:03.717
- There?
- Yes.

181
00:14:03.801 --> 00:14:05.719
I did not expect!

182
00:14:11.392 --> 00:14:13.394
But what am I? She is there.

183
00:14:13.477 --> 00:14:15.145
- It seems there. Yes.
- There?

184
00:14:16.105 --> 00:14:17.106
- Here?
- Yes.

185
00:14:20.901 --> 00:14:21.944
Sorry!

186
00:14:23.404 --> 00:14:25.990
- From stainless steel?
- Yes, from stainless steel.

187
00:14:26.073 --> 00:14:27.658
Next to the containers.

188
00:14:29.326 --> 00:14:31.078
There are my childhood memories.

189
00:14:31.161 --> 00:14:32.496
Really?

190
00:14:33.289 --> 00:14:35.791
I understand.

191
00:14:39.712 --> 00:14:40.546
There is none here.

192
00:14:40.629 --> 00:14:42.798
Yes. And it never was.

193
00:14:43.674 --> 00:14:44.508
What?

194
00:14:50.556 --> 00:14:51.849
No?

195
00:14:51.932 --> 00:14:53.267
There is none. No.

196
00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:55.644
Clear.

197
00:14:59.231 --> 00:15:01.150
The guy opposite is abnormal.

198
00:15:03.319 --> 00:15:04.486
did you go there

199
00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:06.739
Yes, I wanted to ask something.

200
00:15:06.822 --> 00:15:08.198
And what? Do you know him?

201
00:15:09.575 --> 00:15:11.160
No, I don't know.

202
00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:19.251
What's wrong with you both?

203
00:15:31.305 --> 00:15:32.640
Eat tangerines.

204
00:15:33.641 --> 00:15:34.475
Good.

205
00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:43.275
Everything is fine.

206
00:16:01.335 --> 00:16:03.796
I accidentally noticed
how did you go to the cinema

207
00:16:04.964 --> 00:16:07.132
I was wondering if I should say hello

208
00:16:08.133 --> 00:16:10.970
and then saw
how you stare at the poster.

209
00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:24.066
Did Goem tell you this?
He watches all the movies.

210
00:16:29.571 --> 00:16:31.740
Are you going to sit in silence?

211
00:16:34.952 --> 00:16:36.036
Accidentally?

212
00:16:37.579 --> 00:16:38.414
What?

213
00:16:38.497 --> 00:16:41.792
we never saw each other
and here suddenly you are.

214
00:16:43.293 --> 00:16:44.128
So what?

215
00:16:45.004 --> 00:16:49.341
You disappeared without a trace
and decided that now is the time to appear?

216
00:16:54.388 --> 00:16:56.473
Do you think I'm so immature?

217
00:16:57.891 --> 00:16:59.393
If you want to brag, please.

218
00:17:00.477 --> 00:17:01.645
My greetings.

219
00:17:01.729 --> 00:17:03.981
You must have worked a lot
the last five years.

220
00:17:05.232 --> 00:17:08.235
When you said you were going to write a script,
I thought you were just bored.

221
00:17:08.861 --> 00:17:10.112
But you did it.

222
00:17:12.573 --> 00:17:15.075
Yes. Thank you for the greetings.

223
00:17:16.452 --> 00:17:20.289
I imagine what you were thinking about me
these five years.

224
00:17:22.541 --> 00:17:24.168
If you are so proud of me

225
00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:28.130
why did you hesitate so long
and then decided not to watch the movie?

226
00:17:28.964 --> 00:17:29.798
Just…

227
00:17:32.092 --> 00:17:33.177
it's a melodrama.

228
00:17:35.387 --> 00:17:37.473
I thought the movie was about me.

229
00:17:39.141 --> 00:17:39.975
What?

230
00:17:40.059 --> 00:17:44.855
I heard that artists are in everything
draw inspiration when in despair.

231
00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:48.776
I'm sorry, but I wasn't desperate.

232
00:17:49.902 --> 00:17:50.736
Wasn't there?

233
00:17:52.863 --> 00:17:55.074
- Then it's good.
- You are funny.

234
00:17:55.157 --> 00:17:57.534
Did you mention our story in your songs?

235
00:17:59.995 --> 00:18:00.913
Yes.

236
00:18:02.456 --> 00:18:03.290
"Yes"?

237
00:18:03.373 --> 00:18:06.710
I wondered if she would give it to me
at least some inspiration.

238
00:18:07.961 --> 00:18:11.048
We dated for seven years
and I couldn't even write seven measures.

239
00:18:22.601 --> 00:18:25.270
And what? Are you closer to your dream now?

240
00:18:26.105 --> 00:18:28.690
You wanted to be successful
but by an anonymous songwriter.

241
00:18:29.358 --> 00:18:31.235
You have managed with anonymity.

242
00:18:32.236 --> 00:18:34.655
So what? Did you succeed?

243
00:18:37.324 --> 00:18:41.078
don't blame me
lack of inspiration. Maybe it's not yours.

244
00:18:49.294 --> 00:18:50.254
I meant…

245
00:18:50.337 --> 00:18:52.965
It must have been hard to pretend
that you believed in me

246
00:18:53.048 --> 00:18:55.050
No. I meant…

247
00:18:55.134 --> 00:18:56.093
did you finish

248
00:18:56.176 --> 00:18:58.554
Do you want to brag about something else?

249
00:18:59.054 --> 00:19:00.472
can i go

250
00:19:00.556 --> 00:19:01.557
Hong Si Chun.

251
00:19:05.269 --> 00:19:06.103
And more.

252
00:19:07.688 --> 00:19:11.692
It was interesting to meet you
but next time pass by.

253
00:19:13.235 --> 00:19:15.237
Gyom and I are no longer your friends.

254
00:19:39.344 --> 00:19:40.762
This is a "money tree".

255
00:19:40.846 --> 00:19:43.015
- "Congratulations on the new village"?
- And more wine.

256
00:19:43.098 --> 00:19:44.349
Look ahead!

257
00:19:45.434 --> 00:19:47.269
- Hello!
- You came.

258
00:19:47.352 --> 00:19:49.521
- Hello.
- Why so much?

259
00:19:49.605 --> 00:19:51.023
We brought almost nothing.

260
00:19:52.024 --> 00:19:54.776
- Nice house, Chun.
- Here is a money tree.

261
00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:56.195
You will get rich with it.

262
00:19:56.737 --> 00:19:57.821
- Thank you.
- Made a fire?

263
00:19:58.405 --> 00:20:00.616
You have to throw away the sweet potatoes.

264
00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:02.910
- Let's go and wash.
- What?

265
00:20:02.993 --> 00:20:05.329
- Follow me!
- But it is necessary...

266
00:20:05.412 --> 00:20:06.914
Nice house!

267
00:20:06.997 --> 00:20:11.168
She lives opposite.
I can't help but dream of her.

268
