703
00:56:11.826 --> 00:56:14.496
Kids, too fast!

704
00:56:19.459 --> 00:56:21.878
What are you cooking? You bought so much!

705
00:56:21.961 --> 00:56:24.714
- Will you bring it to my house?
- Yes.

706
00:56:25.215 --> 00:56:26.841
- God.
- Today I am free.

707
00:56:28.259 --> 00:56:29.969
I will prepare something delicious for you.

708
00:56:30.470 --> 00:56:32.806
- Can I taste it?
- No doubt!

709
00:56:32.889 --> 00:56:33.807
What is it?

710
00:56:37.727 --> 00:56:39.979
Greetings. Good morning.

711
00:56:45.777 --> 00:56:47.612
- Sit here.
- Good afternoon, madam.

712
00:56:48.613 --> 00:56:50.031
Everything is fine.

713
00:56:51.324 --> 00:56:53.993
- Did you get home normally?
- Yes.

714
00:56:54.577 --> 00:56:56.704
I asked to leave the cape for me.

715
00:56:56.788 --> 00:56:58.289
Don't worry. I will cook more.

716
00:56:58.373 --> 00:56:59.874
OK.

717
